# Lockstep session (res5b): the game saved at card WolfPackOnTheTrail with member 4 Away and members 0..3 at endurance 1 (synth away<card>): the fight is lost
# without orders, everybody on the floor dies and battle result 5 reaches the card (the Away member keeps the party alive)
# the wait after the key that starts the fight: the original gives the next step only once the battle has ended (a running battle is never idle),
# the C# host counts frames (one a pass); the state step inside that wait is left out (inside a battle the original writes the battle's save)
key:t
wait:5
key:l
wait:300
key:enter
wait:100
state:menu
option:3
wait:10
key:enter
wait:300
wait:20000
key:l
wait:300
state:s1
key:enter
wait:20000
wait:300
key:enter
wait:300
state:s3
